				<r3d:description language="eng">DATAPB is a data repository adhering to the CARE and FAIR principles of Open Science. Our repository is integrated into the National Open Science Consortium - CoNCiênciA/CNPq. DATAPB is co-funded by the Paraíba Research Support Foundation (FAPESQ-PB), the French Research Institute for Sustainable Development (IRD), and the Rectorate of the Federal University of Paraíba. The repository is managed by the Postgraduate Program in Ecology and Environmental Monitoring (PPGEMA, UFPB Campus IV) and maintained by a network of volunteer collaborators. Data of any format, area of ​​knowledge, and with any geographic or temporal scope can be deposited.</r3d:description>
